\p{For #{\operatorname{Re}(\lambda_1) = 0} #{\to} a \em{centre} (a term in phase space): #{\mathbf{Y}(t)} is periodic #{\to} closed elliptical trajectories in phase space (right).}

\p{\em{Sense of rotation in spirals?} Determine #{\dot{\mathbf{Y}}} at one point: if #{\dot{y}_2 > 0} at #{\binom{1}{0}} we have anticlockwise rotation; if #{\dot{y}_2 < 0}, clockwise.}
